      "body": "@zovonoir #63821 also adds TP1 tiers for these four shapes, so I measured both tables side by side on main's block32 code (one MI355X, HIP-graph replay with the weights cold in the LLC, median of three rounds). Speedup over main, geometric mean over each range, lowest to highest of the four shapes:\n\n| tokens | #64459 | #63821 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1–32 | 1.01–2.01× | 1.00–1.08× |\n| 48–512 | 1.21–1.80× | 1.20–1.69× |\n| 640–4096 | 0.99–1.00× | 1.08–1.19× |\n\nYours is faster at small batches, mine past 512 tokens. Both PRs add the same four keys, so whichever lands second will need to drop its copies (ruff F601).\n",
